## Overview
Estrus Unified 1.2 brings Chaurus, Spider and Dwemer together in one mod. You can now hatch and raise Chaurus and Spider companions.
 

You no longer need separate downloads of Estrus Chaurus, Estrus Spider, Estrus Dwemer or Estrus for Skyrim. Their required Estrus animation assets and the P+ conversion are included. The normal framework requirements listed below still apply.
