## NEFARAM-Rhiven integration checklist (project notes)

The following are proposed verification steps, **not claims of completed testing**.

1. **Version:** confirm whether the package installed is Unified **1.2 or 1.3**; the pasted description begins with 1.2 but contains a 1.3 changelog.
2. **MO2 cleanup:** for a new game, disable legacy Estrus Chaurus / Dwemer / Spider / Estrus for Skyrim modules, related old script patches and `EstrusForSkyrimNG.dll`. Verify the legacy ESPs do not remain active. **Do not apply the old eight-plugin load-order screenshot to the merged build.**
